51	     * derived from the owner's postcode (see {@link Region#forPostcode}), falling back to {@link LocalityResolver#UNKNOWN}
52	     * when the postcode maps to no known region; {@code HASH8} is the first 8 upper-case hex characters of the SHA-256
53	     * digest of the normalized telephone (see {@link TelephoneNormalizer#canonicalize}) concatenated with the owner's
54	     * last name (e.g. {@code NSW-1A2B3C4D}). Being a pure function of the postcode, telephone and last name it carries
